# tahti-registry (player Store catalog)

This monorepo owns the API (`GET /api/me/import-plugins`). The **Store** catalog users browse in Tahti Player is [janiluuk/tahti-registry](https://github.com/janiluuk/tahti-registry), sibling `../tahti-registry`.

After any plugin that has or needs a Store listing:

- **Added** — add a `plugins.json` row; users must see it in that repo.
- **Changed** — bump the plugin version and the catalog `version`/`downloadUrl`.
- Validate with `pnpm validate` / `pnpm check-plugins` in `tahti-registry`.

Do not treat the API import-plugin list as a substitute for the Store catalog. See root `AGENTS.md` → Official marketplace catalog.
